- Read AGENTS.md first.
- Inspect existing implementation in `models/`, `services/`, and `app/api/`.
- Follow existing architecture. Don't invent new patterns.
- Don't create unnecessary files. Don't duplicate logic.
- Preserve UI consistency using existing Tailwind, Ant Design, and Shadcn UI configurations.
- Use TypeScript strictly.
- Validate API input and protect authentication via Better-Auth.
- Don't modify unrelated files.
